      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Paul%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sisters of Notre Dame de Namur founded the Paul Parochial School in 1844, originally calling it Sainte Marie de Willamette.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
